            <div xml:id="m-d354e4a8-c4d0-46dc-854a-ddd4c5db097f">
              <lg xml:id="m-a45ba3b6-5f44-4f71-91c8-a1a7cc55d5e9">
                <l xml:id="m-2fd59e6d-1f5a-4c38-b760-ac332262e279" facs="#m-2c530a0c-1c7d-4142-a4d0-b12227e3e86a" label="text-like">Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-bdf992bc-a408-46ce-adf5-81864999b7ba" facs="#m-15d8f3d6-3d50-4bbb-bc7e-0875cb687aa2" label="ambiguous">1099</l><l xml:id="m-9e68b4e1-c1ae-4bd7-a4b4-79abf3379dfd" facs="#m-5aec036a-89cc-467b-85bf-7fc9abdd813e" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-77dc8fed-5de2-4735-be96-5f9d0233e3f0" facs="#m-890f7161-9622-435f-bae4-3d171fe74e67" label="lyrics-like">Ostra tibi Dómine, quaésumus, efficiant, * et ad remédia perdúcant</l><l xml:id="m-85df11d2-7f7e-456a-b3a3-45a5cd84286b" facs="#m-2b383ed2-7f41-434a-aaa3-e0e16475b384" label="lyrics-like">AL sint accépta jejúnia: t quae) aetérna. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-83ac48a6-cc2c-485d-bc1f-aff20614ed18" facs="#m-4a82c830-007c-47d1-94f2-58bd2e6fb37a" label="lyrics-like">nos et expiándo, grátia tua dignos</l><l xml:id="m-f7811b44-7c95-4dac-80ac-f48cb06688ea" facs="#m-c184d767-0cb4-4fe1-9469-d34745d80d56" label="text-like">At vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-04117c92-b81b-46c8-bb18-7c6453aceab5" facs="#m-227407a2-efac-41e8-b08c-912e740b56be" label="ambiguous">Ant. i.</l><l xml:id="m-40608a9b-4bb1-4d75-8c17-ec9edae54753" facs="#m-782bb937-ac81-45f6-89b2-4615b3490410" label="lyrics-like">X OS ascéndi-te“ ad dí-em féstum hunc:é-go</l><l xml:id="m-5da7ae2b-a233-40df-a7aa-78c89f7f020d" facs="#m-61271c25-e789-4b81-8c4d-95601f703cab" label="lyrics-like">non ascéndam, qui-a témpus mé-um nondum advé-nit.</l><l xml:id="m-519a82e2-7886-4a3e-9829-5494dc4869b2" facs="#m-129f8635-45fd-4fbf-a90d-0e17d46969d1" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-80293ac0-ae70-4cb1-9e15-64c7b7891ed0" facs="#m-ca6de359-ded3-44c9-8698-d380c7b9cea4" label="lyrics-like">A nobis, quaésumus Dómine, et mérito et número pópulus tibi</l><l xml:id="m-9cd67458-55d0-4aa2-a744-c77d9fa1e5c7" facs="#m-8f31e74d-bf44-4df7-b20c-fed822095151" label="lyrics-like"> perseverántem in tua voluntáte ] sérviens augeátur. Per Dòminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9ed2a6c2-0d65-4161-a171-be44bb95245c" facs="#m-f57e9b41-2e03-4a18-88d0-b183c285ce96" label="lyrics-like">famulátum : * ut in diébus nostris,</l><l xml:id="m-02165276-9ac0-46ea-92dc-ae5a45f306ee" facs="#m-8d7492e1-a6af-4e8a-8a7b-72a10f1d9080" label="ambiguous">Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-aadd9560-cea9-4586-9fb8-1d25e4656268" facs="#m-a1c3a356-683a-4e46-8de7-e29f5ca88165" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-1b758b09-9340-4b12-a3de-e48e4156d61e" facs="#m-1882501d-8551-47c4-b72a-ed8e12da3d1c" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-8c6a2442-751f-4e4e-81d8-fb0951045e13" facs="#m-b90396cc-76c1-4d29-acae-f7a20864adcd" label="ambiguous">9</l><l xml:id="m-526029b0-442c-40f7-a87e-5c9488655d1d" facs="#m-d5e0b5a2-5c3b-44ea-b5f0-7a9bbb494611" label="lyrics-like">-ves mé-ae “ vócem mé-am áudi-unt: et égo</l><l xml:id="m-d47c949f-14e2-478d-b86a-2d9ac4022548" facs="#m-58ae060c-1626-47da-ba13-1e1cb2b318ab" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus agnósco é¬as.</l><l xml:id="m-02fada88-5f5f-4456-8b83-0aeeb7a7d306" facs="#m-b706d17a-e614-45b1-9076-faa0fc05587a" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-7d794ae4-efee-4a84-878e-d8bbd200d517" facs="#m-03c64d1f-7b59-47e1-a130-29d9cb973ee3" label="lyrics-like">YAnctificáto hoc jejúnio, Deus, ]praestas afféctum, * praebe suppli¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab53223a-3217-4312-b17e-fdabadfa596f" facs="#m-e1d9d844-7e83-40af-95a9-c73b8835cc81" label="lyrics-like">cántibus pium benignus auditum.</l><l xml:id="m-e8e19b5d-2a04-4eac-ba73-bb2ba5e24789" facs="#m-bdd057e3-1a44-434d-90bf-5fe4b488d050" label="lyrics-like">O tuórum corda fidélium miserá¬</l><l xml:id="m-255d15d1-e941-4204-94b5-52615677c674" facs="#m-112f639f-90ca-4301-b07d-a249cb1f8eda" label="lyrics-like">tor illústra: t et quibus devotiónis Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-cb7f07f0-6167-457f-b0a7-aaa535ba9c1e" facs="#m-6f4455b7-ca26-423d-9a9a-8d1cfe5652b4" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-3b77a99f-a152-4aa6-937e-374b70992835" facs="#m-5f61e487-2bbf-41d9-8b42-939118ed3649" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-d8afe112-c33d-4f6d-b104-ebc252497a99" facs="#m-32a70b56-749b-4ff3-8aa3-beae126c616f" label="lyrics-like">Ulta bóna ópera “operá-tus sum vóbis: pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-40fecc39-5a32-4125-be13-4ce0ca7ad744" facs="#m-30db4e2a-be44-4712-80c5-9f1b27ee6117" label="lyrics-like">pter quod ópus vúltis me occíde-re?</l><l xml:id="m-a764941b-4ebf-4924-ac7a-85a0de073532" facs="#m-8b194473-2545-4935-b767-2e4f85814f26" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-7748d949-53e7-4bdc-9b7a-9a8a521c5ba1" facs="#m-9431b336-65ad-4211-8739-4fcc00e368bf" label="lyrics-like">I Désto supplicatiónibus nostris! ges, consuétae misericórdiae tribue</l><l xml:id="m-784f698d-10a2-414e-a458-2984156a0b42" facs="#m-f343fdd2-605d-4b34-ae3d-a374041aac81" label="lyrics-like">benígnus efféctum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2c551d4b-e58e-45cb-9f10-5c330b184f59" facs="#m-e77514a3-6125-40f0-aa63-372d95e8192a" label="ambiguous">A omnipotens Deus:* et quibus</l><l xml:id="m-9180fd4e-5fcc-4ef9-b8fd-83ffb94fc1d7" facs="#m-5d984167-4ab5-4201-be32-c56546fe54de" label="lyrics-like">fidúciam sperándae pietátis indúl¬</l></lg>
